adapted from lib/edit/t_angwil.txt at FrogComposband/RoguelikeFansBand commit
a0d92b6378d148c5262cc236b8fa6ed2ca06a54c. This imported layout is an exception
to the statement above that legacy content is not included; the repository's
default licenses do not replace its upstream terms. Its source attribution is:
"by Brett Flannigan (at least the original, as of 10-8-98; feel free to tweak
it as you please)"; "Tweaked 03-9-2017". The original file also identifies it
as a mainly elven town. Source mapping and this adaptation's scope are recorded
in design/angwil-town-plan-20260909.md and
packs/rfb-demo-original/legacy-wilderness-selection.json.

The Outpost town layout in packs/rfb-demo-original/worlds/middle-earth.json
is adapted from lib/edit/t_outp.txt and lib/edit/t_pref.txt at the same
