individual author. This layout is also an exception to the statement above
that legacy content is not included, and remains subject to its upstream
terms rather than this repository's default content license. No permission
statement from the Angwil map is attributed to this material. The source
selection and adaptation scope are recorded in
packs/rfb-demo-original/legacy-wilderness-selection.json and
design/outpost-map-plan-20260910.md.

